cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Messenger-Native SaaS — starter kit"
message: "If you build on this pattern, please cite it and link back."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Paweł
    family-names: Jurewicz
    affiliation: Heartmade Studio
repository-code: "https://github.com/heartmade-studio/messenger-native-saas"
url: "https://moonq.app"
abstract: >-
  A forkable, runnable starter for Messenger-Native SaaS: subscription products
  whose entire interface lives inside a chat app. Telegram Bot API on Supabase
  Edge Functions (Deno) and Postgres, with optional Gemini, Stripe, PostHog and
  Sentry adapters. Centered on an onboarding-first conversation that activates a
  free trial without a web form or card.
keywords:
  - telegram
  - supabase
  - deno
